WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.100
First-year capital is
about ten million dollars.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.293
Branch equipment is five million,
hub equipment about one million,

3
00:00:07.293 --> 00:00:10.800
and the control plane and
services nearly four million.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.300
Steady-state recurring cost is about
fifteen point seven million a year,

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.825
mostly internet circuits and
the security service edge.

6
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:23.605
Against that, retiring the old circuits at
twelve hundred dollars an office a month

7
00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:25.753
removes twenty-one point six million,

8
00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:28.663
a net saving of about five
point nine million a year.

9
00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:33.751
These are planning estimates, not quotes,
with hardware at a forty percent discount.

10
00:00:33.751 --> 00:00:38.400
Replace every figure with the estate's
own data before a budget submission.
